{"pin":"BH04748","subcodes":[{"code":"BH04748","anchor":"","first_line":"Glorified art Thou, O Lord of Names and Creator of Heaven! Thou seest me within the talons of Thine enemies who have violated the Covenant [3.5s]... ...O Lord, Thou seest the tears of mine eyes and Thou hearest the sorrow in my heart's lamentation. I beseech Thee, O Thou Lord Eternal","first_line_orig":"سبحانک یا مالک الاسماء و فاطر السماء ترانی بین مخالب اعدائک الذین نقضوا  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"200","translations":[{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15696.148e","source":"BLIB_Or15696","locator":"148e"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADM2#027 p.047x","source":"ADM2","locator":"027 p.047x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/558.pdf#page=47"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AQA6#257 p.250b","source":"AQA6","locator":"257 p.250b","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/567.pdf"},{"kind":"translation","code":"JHT_S#090x","source":"JHT_S","locator":"090x","url":"https://joshuahalltranslations.com/jalal/2017/10/Supplications-by-Bahaullah-1.pdf#page=41"}]},{"code":"BH04748HOP","anchor":"hop","translations":[{"language":"tk","lang_name":"Turkmen"},{"language":"zh-Hans","lang_name":"Simplified Chinese"},{"language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"language":"zh-Hant","lang_name":"Traditional Chinese"}]}]}
